id: pm-rlm-sr0b
title: Align empty response checkpoint validation with engine recovery
description: "GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/issues/5. The engine writes empty string responses as billable invalid-action refusals, while the loader rejects them as incomplete. Accept every engine-written response state while rejecting non-string values. Prove completed replay/resume and interrupted recovery on real SDK trackers."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-19T00:39:09.718Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T12:12:03.763Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:19:23.428Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:19:23.428Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "Empty, whitespace and malformed JSON string responses survive completed and interrupted recovery; non-string persisted responses remain incomplete refusals; regression fails when loader fix is reverted."
parent: pm-rlm-a1ih
comments[4]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T00:47:30.607Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Issue 5 reproduced before the fix: both completed and interrupted empty-response regressions failed with incomplete from load. Cause: the writer accepts every string, while the loader used nonempty text validation. Loader now accepts empty strings, preserving recorded invalid-action refusals and rejecting non-string values. Focused controls for malformed JSON and whitespace pass, completed resume performs no inference, and interrupted recovery reuses its pending reservation."
  - created_at: "2026-10-19T00:55:34.080Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Revert evidence: restoring only nonempty response-text validation makes both completed empty-response replay and interrupted empty-response recovery fail their assertions. The real-SDK suite also preserves rejection of non-string responses and malformed settlement markers. The package-wide proof runner passed 24/24 with exact source hash restoration; the issue-linked pm test run passed 1/1 command (2/2 tests)."
  - created_at: "2026-10-21T19:13:07.073Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Authorized tracker reconciliation, audit 2026-10-21. Reverified current main ef32c4cad9ad: merged #2 (90b99a0); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Align empty response checkpoint validation with engine recovery.** [PR #2](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/2) (90b99a0), refined in #8, delivers typed complete environment reads, durable call ledger/budgets, crash resume, versioned replay, bounded adapters and terminal child-refusal evidence; corresponding real-SDK and behavioral-revert fixtures are committed."
    edited_at: "2026-10-22T12:12:03.763Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-21T19:17:48.968Z"
    author: codex-agent
    text: "Authorized tracker reconciliation, audit 2026-10-21. Owner-authorized takeover of any historical assignment for this verified terminal transition. Reverified current main ef32c4cad9ad: merged #2 (90b99a0); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Align empty response checkpoint validation with engine recovery.** [PR #2](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/2) (90b99a0), refined in #8, delivers typed complete environment reads, durable call ledger/budgets, crash resume, versioned replay, bounded adapters and terminal child-refusal evidence; corresponding real-SDK and behavioral-revert fixtures are committed."
